Description: [Mozio] - The Promo code amount is NOT displayed as expected for Return trip tickets in the Mozio email confirmation. When a return trip ticket has a promo code applied, the discount amount is missing or incorrect in the Mozio email confirmation. The root cause is in the return-trip code path within create-reservations.mappers.ts where station-swap logic exists but discount propagation to the Mozio dispatch report is not handled for the return-trip segment.

Proposed verification criteria:
